###  http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/annotation-property/hasAssessmentQuestion
tara-ap:hasAssessmentQuestion rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty ;
                              dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Hammerschlag R, Milley RJ, Colbert A, Weih J, Yohalem-Ilsley B, Mist S, Aickin M. Randomized Controlled Trials of Acupuncture (1997–2007): An Assessment of Reporting Quality with a CONSORT- and STRICTA-Based Instrument. Evidence-Based Complementary and Alternative Medicine. 2011;2011:183910. https://doi.org/10.1155/2011/183910" ;
                              dcterms:description """The exact OCSI assessment question text for the item scored by this property.

Item questions (Table 1, Hammerschlag et al. 2011) and scoring rubrics (Appendix A, Hammerschlag et al. 2011) reproduced under the CC-BY license, with attribution to the original authors."""@en ;
                              dcterms:source "https://doi.org/10.1155/2011/183910" ;
                              rdfs:label "Assessment Question" ;
                              rdfs:subPropertyOf dcterms:relation ;
                              rdfs:range xsd:string .


###  http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/annotation-property/hasCompactURI
tara-ap:hasCompactURI rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty ;
                      rdfs:subPropertyOf dcterms:identifier .


###  http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/annotation-property/hasCurationSourceLink
tara-ap:hasCurationSourceLink rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty ;
                              rdfs:subPropertyOf dcterms:source .


###  http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/annotation-property/hasOCSIItemNumber
tara-ap:hasOCSIItemNumber rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty ;
                          dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Hammerschlag R, Milley RJ, Colbert A, Weih J, Yohalem-Ilsley B, Mist S, Aickin M. Randomized Controlled Trials of Acupuncture (1997–2007): An Assessment of Reporting Quality with a CONSORT- and STRICTA-Based Instrument. Evidence-Based Complementary and Alternative Medicine. 2011;2011:183910. https://doi.org/10.1155/2011/183910" ;
                          dcterms:description """The standard item number (1-27) in the Oregon CONSORT STRICTA Instrument (OCSI), Table 1, that this property scores.

Item questions (Table 1, Hammerschlag et al. 2011) and scoring rubrics (Appendix A, Hammerschlag et al. 2011) reproduced under the CC-BY license, with attribution to the original authors."""@en ;
                          rdfs:label "OCSI Item Number" ;
                          rdfs:subPropertyOf dcterms:relation ;
                          rdfs:range tara-kb:ocsiItemNumber .


###  http://www.acupunctureresearch.org/tara/ontology/annotation-property/hasScoringInstructions
tara-ap:hasScoringInstructions rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty ;
                               dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Hammerschlag R, Milley RJ, Colbert A, Weih J, Yohalem-Ilsley B, Mist S, Aickin M. Randomized Controlled Trials of Acupuncture (1997–2007): An Assessment of Reporting Quality with a CONSORT- and STRICTA-Based Instrument. Evidence-Based Complementary and Alternative Medicine. 2011;2011:183910. https://doi.org/10.1155/2011/183910" ;
                               dcterms:description """The OCSI Appendix A per-question guidance clarifying how to award a score of yes (2), partial (1), no (0), or N/A for the item scored by this property.

Item questions (Table 1, Hammerschlag et al. 2011) and scoring rubrics (Appendix A, Hammerschlag et al. 2011) reproduced under the CC-BY license, with attribution to the original authors."""@en ;
                               rdfs:label "Scoring Instructions" ;
                               rdfs:subPropertyOf dcterms:relation ;
                               rdfs:range xsd:string .


